  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nDecoding signs:\n\n \n \n\n Sign\n P\n Q\n R\n S\n \n \n\n Stands For\n ×\n ÷\n -\n +\n \n \n\nGiven: (110 R 32) Q 2 S 9 P 4 R 21 = ?\n\n(110 R 32) Q 2 S 9 P 4 R 21 = ? ⇒ (110 - 32) ÷ 2 + 9 × 4 - 21 = ?\n\n⇒ __**(110 - 32)**__ ÷ 2 + 9 × 4 - 21 = ?\n\n⇒ __**78 ÷**____** 2**__ + 9 × 4 - 21 = ?\n\n⇒ 39 + __**9 **____**×**____** 4**__ - 21 = ?\n\n⇒ __**39**____** + 36**__ - 21 = ?\n\n⇒ **__75__**__** - 21**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 54 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
